<title>USA: Omaha cattle steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were active, prices were steady to $0.50 higher.</p>
<p>Steers - select to largely choice 2-43 1100-1350 lbs 67.00-68.00, couple loads 68.50. Select 64.00-67.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select to mostly choice 2-4 975-1250 lbs 66.50-68.00, few 68.50. Select 63.00-67.00.</p>
